Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else in the world.\NIt's so much love I don't want to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dreams, I don't want to lose my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After reaching the continent of Server,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we found a Koromon village, but\Nit was occupied by the Pagumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, during dinner, Poyomon\Ndigivolved to Tokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That night, little Toko was\Ntaken from our campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon finally found him and\Nall the Koromon in a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were being guarded by the Gazimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who were also planning on\Ngiving us to their leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that rock and roll digi-jerk Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:02:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his music like a weapon\Nand tried to destroy the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the crest for Ty's tag,\Nand it created an escape for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:15.03,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Dark Evolution! SkullGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how far do we have to walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until Etemon can't follow us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there is such a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We certainly can't stop here\Nin the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one thing, if we were attacked,\Nthere'd be no place for us to run to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is starting to look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's becoming so timid and afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd we stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's everyone so scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we do have the crest, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, but do we really know the\Ncrest will help Agumon to Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, buddy, this is your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one that\Ncan digivolve further,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so either you try to get to the\Nnext level and save us from Etemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or I'll go and get myself a new Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how are we supposed to\Nuse the Crest to digivolve again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, from what we've seen so\Nfar with the other Digivolutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it takes a lot of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, they can't\Ndigivolve if they're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition, the partner of the\NDigimon must be in some sort of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like being\Nunder attack or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since it's a higher\Nlevel of digivolving,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my theory is even more energy is needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll provide the food,\NEtemon will provide the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch out,\Nyou Digidestined kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.19,0:03:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I do, you'll wish\Nyou'll never cross, Etemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more teensy bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for the second course?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop your belly aching and open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep on eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone's given you their\Nfood so that you can digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't give him our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took it from us of all the nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the food won't do us any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still can't digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So those of us who don't\Nwork don't eat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, "Is that right? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, that's why you've got to try\Nyour best to protect everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come on, buddy. Keep eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there's not much\Nelse we can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if Agumon can take much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Tai is really pushing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon's stuffed like\Na Thanksgiving turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need that energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's personality has taken\Na turn for the worse lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember him being friendlier\Neven to us younger kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, now that you mention it,\Nhe was cool during soccer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, pass it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance to shoot. Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice pass, Tai I thought you were going\Nto take the shot yourself Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no I in team Tai might look\Nlike he's trying to run things all by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,himself But whatever crazy action he\Ntakes He does it for the good of the team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now all this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones who can help now So\Nyou've got to keep eating, okay, Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's personality seems\Nto have changed ever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since he got a hold of\Nthat crest of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tag is blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be reacting to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest must be near\Na lie. You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a big building or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be where my crest is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a cable doing out\Nin the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Lord Etemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's caught in my network.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The intruder's in the L7 sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, L7, L7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this thing work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's near the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I hold my\Nannual Tribute to Me show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're doing\Nall the way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe they want\Nto get good seats, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we'll have a perfect view for the\Nsurprise show I'm planning for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Area L7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help you? It's Etemon. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, little bunny, you should\Nbe having some guests soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get ready to welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you mean... Bingo, bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Roman Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the Roman Colosseum?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Tentomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's an ancient arena But the ancient one\Ndidn't have big screens Or soccer goals
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, let's all split\Nup and look for the crest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move anymore Let me rest\Nfor a little bit Come on, get up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can do it I can't Give him a rest,\NTai The only clue we have is my tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Gomamon and I will\Nsearch for the crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys relax for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soccer ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, anybody up for a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human team will play\Nagainst the Digimon team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth is soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You use your feet to try to\Nget this ball into the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can also use your chest or your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's really using your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I forgot to tell you,\Nyou can't use your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you're the goalkeeper, then you\Ncan touch the ball with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you should be the\Ngoalie for your team, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're playing\Nsoccer at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you use your heads for something\Nother than hitting the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sooner Joe finds the\Ncrest, the sooner we can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tag is reacting again. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest must be around\Nhere somewhere. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goal. Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I scored a gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing was a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he really think he can\Ntrap us with a simple net?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, there's electricity\Nrunning through that net.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shocker, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to be there in person\Nto do this myself, but I'm way too busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how us rock and roll legends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, the axe substituting\Nfor me is a very rare treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's see if you can put\Nyour puny little heads
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together and figure out who our\Nspecial guest star is. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would we know who it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a different Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I knew you'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose to that bony baloney!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, you've got to digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, this doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for if you\Ncan't digivolve again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve, Koromon, you've got to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't he digivolve to the next level?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not working, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crust isn't reacting at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you gave him too much to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can't digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:11:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Greymon, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in your power\Nand you can digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He certainly doesn't\Nhave any digi manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least they excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I imagining it, or is he\Nmoving a lot slower than usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He consumed way too much, so\Nhis reflexes are sluggish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's looking like this is going\Nto be over sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You silly rabbits stop carrying\Non like a trained seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the fireworks ready so I can\Ncelebrate my victory. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Launching fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did those fish come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they just come\Nout of there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but if it's\Nnot broken, don't fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really elementary, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's probably just a dimensional\Nvortex rift in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ditto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, fishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what are we going\Nto do to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should dig a hole\Nand tunnel our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a black cable here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rock is in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tag, it's reacting again. What if
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this rock is the crest\Nwe've been looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if this really is the crest\Nthat goes with my tag then maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my crest, yes. Look, a\Ntunnel! We can get out through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how do you like that not only\Ndid those little darlings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escape but they found another\Ncrest too this is unforgivable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, you could win\Nif you'd only Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to make him\NDigivolve to the next level!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please mind your own business, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Tai, without a reaction from the\Ncrest, there's no way for him to Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make him do it! Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:15:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other condition for digivolving\Nis their partner must be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your Nova Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of a big fake like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fire breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dope who thinks he's a superstar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now start singing your final number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, you've got to help Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go too, Gabumon. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon! Get Evo! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:16:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon, I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Greymon! Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what in the world what\Ndo you think that is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my is that what i\Nthink it is what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call that thing skull Koromon the sight of
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}SkullGreymon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Skeleton Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.54,0:17:19.51,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ground Zero
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him makes other digimon\Ntremble he is a fully
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digivolved digimon whose explosive power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,causes him to constantly\Nsearch for battle this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be very bad\Nthere's been some mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's digivolved\Ninto a horrible monster
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is... Greymon's evolved form...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Skull Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're really the Digivolve form\Nof Greymon, then you can't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centarumon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, my poor network.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're destroying everything\Nthat I worked so hard to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you are way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thorn Bluster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a true shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I wonder what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His energy ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Koromon again! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've done some\Nterrible, horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I savagely attacked three\Nof my fellow Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry I didn't live up\Nto your expectations of me, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who's to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to put it all on you, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Sora? Yeah. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what I was doing, but\NI kept pushing people around anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt like because I had the crest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to be in charge and fight on my own\Nwithout any help from the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were finally able to digivolve,\Nbut it was a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if our Digimon will ever\Nbe able to digivolve the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for sure, I learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me. I'll see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold. It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's a jacket with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream that I love\Nyou, and it's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun will shine in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Illusionary Ship's Captain, Cockatrimon!

